B = [
('San Ildefonso Pueblo Pottery', 'North America', '1920s-present', 'ceramics', 'In the style of San Ildefonso Pueblo Pottery, sleek, dark, formal, sculptural and timeless. Perfectly symmetrical, hand-built forms with a full rounded volume and a crisp change of angle where the curve turns. The surface is burnished to a glass-smooth gloss and smoked to a deep jet black. Designs appear in matte black against the shining black field, visible only as light shifts across them. Motifs are bold and graphic, such as coiled serpents, rain clouds, stepped shapes, lightning zigzags, mountains and small tracks, arranged in one confident band. Perfect balance, calm and ceremonial.'),
('Jawa', 'Russia and Eastern Europe', '1950s-70s', 'motorcycles', 'In the style of Jawa, solid, simple, mid-century and slightly sporty, with plenty of shine. Compact, rounded, teardrop-like forms with swept-back lines and a lean, tidy stance. Colour is two-tone glossy enamel, maroon and cream, black and red, deep blue and white, or olive and cream, divided by clean lines and finished with fine hand-painted gold pinstripes. Bright chrome and polished metal accents catch the light against the deep gloss colour. Small bold enamel-style badges and neat round motifs. Honest, optimistic, proudly engineered and built to last, with the cheerful confidence of post-war Central European industry.'),
('Zsolnay', 'Russia and Eastern Europe', '1880s-1910s', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Zsolnay, Art Nouveau iridescent ceramics. The signature is a shimmering metallic lustre glaze that shifts between gold, green, magenta, purple, cobalt and copper-red as the light changes, like a beetle wing or an oil slick. Forms are sinuous and sculpted, with swelling volumes, flared tops, whiplash curves and organic extensions like tendrils and lizards. Decoration is relief-modelled flowers, leaves, dragonflies, peacock feathers, seaweed and faces, with matte backgrounds and glossy iridescence on selected areas. Warm orange, green, turquoise, ochre and cobalt glazes appear in patterns of scales and chevrons. Lavish, jewel-like, organic and fin-de-siecle.'),
('Zastava Automobiles', 'Russia and Eastern Europe', '1980s', 'cars', 'In the style of Zastava Automobiles, small, square-cut, boxy, cheap, honest, utilitarian and distinctively late socialist era. Flat near-vertical planes, thin black plastic trim, rectangular shapes, compact blocky proportions, a pronounced horizontal shoulder line and sharply cut corners. Nothing is decorated and every edge is straight. Colour is plain gloss red, sky blue, white, yellow, silver-grey, beige or orange, sometimes with a thin bright stripe. A small stylised emblem sits quietly in a corner. Materials are hard brown or black plastic and plaid or striped cloth. Modest, practical and worn with pride.'),
('Haapsalu Shawl', 'Russia and Eastern Europe', '19th century-present', 'textiles', 'In the style of Haapsalu Shawl, extremely fine, cobweb-thin knitted lace so light it could be drawn through a ring. Composition is a calm, symmetrical central field framed by a border and a distinct edge. Patterns are airy open-work motifs, small raised bobbles, diamond lozenges, leaf shapes, fir cones, bell flowers, snowflakes and ripples, finished with a scalloped, saw-toothed edge of tiny points. Colour is natural white or ivory, sometimes pale grey, soft peach or faded rose. The texture is fuzzy, misty and ethereal, with a delicate halo of loose fibres, like frost on a window or cobwebs in morning dew. Delicate, geometric and romantic, with mathematical patience.'),
('Avanos Pottery', 'Middle East', 'ancient-present', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Avanos Pottery, warm, earthy, ancient, handmade red clay. Rich terracotta, brick-red and dark brown bodies with wide swelling bellies, narrow tops and sturdy, chunky shapes, sometimes playfully modelled like a face or bird. Decoration is applied with slip, incised lines and glaze, in spirals, hatched bands, sun discs, tulip and carnation flowers, stylised birds, geometric borders, zigzags and dots in cream, brown, turquoise, green and cobalt blue. Surfaces may be unglazed matte, or covered with glossy green or amber glaze, showing cracks and pooled colour. Rustic, folk and timeless.'),
('Roots Canada', 'North America', '1980s-present', 'fashion', 'In the style of Roots Canada, warm, casual, woodsy cabin-in-the-woods outdoor lifestyle. A simple standing animal emblem on small branches, set above a name in a slightly rounded vintage serif, often rendered in a bright colour. Thick, soft heather-grey textures with bold, chunky lettering and roomy, relaxed proportions. Soft saddle-brown leather with stamped marks, collegiate mixes of wool with leather, and thick, generous forms. Colours are earthy and rustic, forest green, burgundy, navy, camel, cream, red and black plaid and maple-red accents. Cosy, outdoorsy, friendly and unpretentious.'),
('Rorstrand', 'Europe', '1950s', 'ceramics', 'In the style of Rorstrand, gentle, light, sophisticated, calm and domestic quiet Scandinavian modernism. White glossy surfaces with softly shaded cobalt-blue flowers painted along the edges, loose organic leaf outlines and a soft airbrush-like gradient, on plain curving silhouettes. Slender rounded lines, shallow volumes and thin, slightly rounded edges. Other treatments offer rustic mottled blue-and-white, green-and-brown speckled glaze, and trailing lines of blue stripes. Earlier decoration shows delicate printed lace, chinoiserie scenes and sprays of green leaves. Restrained palette of white, blue, soft green and brown.'),
('66 North', 'Europe', '2000s-present', 'fashion', 'In the style of 66 North, austere, volcanic, windy and functional Icelandic weatherproof design. Bold, practical, enveloping volumes with overlapping layers, visible seams, crisp adjustable edges and generous scale, in matte waterproof surfaces in strong colours such as bright red, orange, deep blue, black, moss green and ochre. Surfaces use long parallel channels and stranded patterns in grey, cream and charcoal, and the mark is tiny and in plain capitals. Proportions are long, broad and roomy, like arctic working gear refined into minimalism. Subtle sheen under rain and chunky, oversized detailing.'),
('Desigual', 'Europe', '2000s-2010s', 'fashion', 'In the style of Desigual, an exuberant, loud, joyful collage, optimistic, artistic, free and bohemian. Patchwork panels cut from different floral, geometric and animal patterns, bright embroidery, appliques, studs, sequins, lace inserts and ragged edges, mixing several patterns together, with hearts, butterflies, flowers, stripes, ethnic motifs, mosaic tiles, polka dots, graffiti and cartoon-like faces. Colours riot in turquoise, fuchsia, orange, lime, red, royal blue and yellow against black or white. Worn-in painted surfaces and sectioned stitched areas, with a big stylised swirling logo. Shapes stay simple so the busy print mix carries the look, with mismatched details and playful contrast.'),
('Chupa Chups', 'Europe', '1960s-70s', 'confectionery', 'In the style of Chupa Chups, playful, sugary, cheeky and very pop. Simple round shapes and clean sticks of form, with a glossy, candy-like shine and thin crinkled shimmer. The mark is a bright daisy-like flower with a yellow circle in the middle and red petals, with the name in friendly rounded white and yellow letters, on bright red, yellow or orange. Flavours are signalled by colour, pink, orange, green, cola brown and lemon yellow, some swirled with two colours. Hot-pink or red fields radiate outward in a sunburst. Cartoon children and sugary cheerfulness.'),
]
